# Pairs with TypeOK. A failed self-retirement owes a key the pin store does not
# have.
MODULE: TypeOkSelfRetireFailInvalidKey
TARGET: TypeOK
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a failed self-retirement owes an undeclared key
PERTURBS: SelfRetireFail

--- FIND
SelfRetireFail(k) ==
    /\ k \in owed
    /\ owed' = owed \ {k}
--- REPLACE
SelfRetireFail(k) ==
    /\ k \in owed
\* MUTATION: an undeclared key.
    /\ owed' = (owed \ {k}) \cup {"k3"}
--- END
